#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:1
msgid "Site UI Modules"
msgstr "Site UI 模块"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:3
msgid ""
"This page is for frontend developers building a distribution's own public"
" pages. If configuration and branding are enough, see [Distribution "
"customization](distribution-customization.md) instead."
msgstr ""
"本页面向为发行版构建自有公开页面的前端开发者。如果配置和品牌就够用，请改看[发行版定制](distribution-"
"customization.md)。"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:7
msgid ""
"A Site UI module replaces the public pages a visitor sees (the landing "
"page, the frame around the account pages, the legal page) without forking"
" the console. It is a small tree of React components that the frontend "
"image compiles in next to the shared application, which still provides "
"the one console and session."
msgstr ""
"Site UI 模块可以替换访客看到的公开页面（首页、账号页的外框、法律页面），而无需 fork 控制台。它是一小棵 React "
"组件树，由前端镜像编译进去，与共享应用并列；共享应用仍然提供同一个控制台和会话。"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:19
msgid ""
"`C` is the upstream source commit and `U` the distribution's UI source "
"commit; pin both when you build a release. The module is never fetched or"
" swapped at runtime, so a change to its components, stylesheet or wording"
" needs a new frontend image. Runtime branding that the module reads still"
" changes at runtime."
msgstr ""
"`C` 是上游源码提交，`U` 是发行版 UI "
"的源码提交；构建发布版本时两者都要钉住。模块从不在运行时下载或替换，因此修改它的组件、样式表或文案都需要新的前端镜像。模块读取的运行时品牌仍会在运行时变化。"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:25
msgid "What a module can and cannot change"
msgstr "模块能改什么、不能改什么"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md
msgid "The module owns"
msgstr "模块负责"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md
msgid "The shared application keeps"
msgstr "共享应用保留"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md
msgid "the home page, if it exports one"
msgstr "模块导出的首页"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md
msgid ""
"dashboard, chat, admin, team and authorize pages, and the `/agents` proxy"
" integration"
msgstr "仪表盘、聊天、管理后台、团队和授权页面，以及 `/agents` 代理集成"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md
msgid "the frame around the account pages, and where each field's parts go"
msgstr "账号页面外壳，以及每个字段各部分的位置"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md
msgid "the account forms, their fields, validation and submit calls"
msgstr "账号表单、字段、验证与提交请求"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md
msgid "the legal text and the sign-up confirmations, if it ships its own"
msgstr "模块自带的法律文本和注册确认项"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md
msgid ""
"the consent step, the one `accepted_tos` flag sign-up records, and the "
"terms anchors the account pages link to"
msgstr "注册同意步骤、注册时记录的那一个 `accepted_tos` 标志，以及账号页面链接到的条款锚点"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md
msgid "its own wording for the account pages"
msgstr "它为账号页面写的文案"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md
msgid "the schemas, error codes, session handling and redirect rules"
msgstr "schema、错误码、会话处理和重定向规则"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md
msgid "the public pages' titles, and the language of the pages it renders"
msgstr "公开页面的标题，以及它渲染的页面用什么语言"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md
msgid "every console page's title and language"
msgstr "所有控制台页面的标题和语言"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md
msgid "its own stylesheet and design assets"
msgstr "它自己的样式表和设计资源"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md
msgid "the runtime branding document and `/site-config`"
msgstr "运行时品牌文档与 `/site-config`"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:36
msgid ""
"A module cannot change who gets in. Sign-in logic, the registration gate,"
" email verification and permissions stay in the shared application, "
"together with the session store, proxy rules and the accessibility "
"behavior of `AuthField`, `AuthNotice` and `AuthLoading`. A module cannot "
"register a route or take over an unlisted page; a new path such as "
"`/pricing`, a console redesign or a new authentication method is an "
"application change."
msgstr ""
"模块无法改变谁能进来。登录逻辑、注册限制、邮箱验证和权限都留在共享应用中，会话存储、代理规则以及 `AuthField`、`AuthNotice`"
" 和 `AuthLoading` 的无障碍行为也是如此。模块不能注册路由，也不能接管未列出的页面；新增 `/pricing` "
"这样的路径、重新设计控制台或新的认证方式，都属于应用层面的改动。"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:43
msgid ""
"The host facade gives a module the public site configuration, resolved "
"branding, session state (enough to choose between a sign-in and a console"
" link) and the supported presentation types and helpers. It offers no "
"login, logout, token or other authentication operation. The TypeScript "
"interfaces are in `apps/frontend/src/site-ui/contract.ts`, and the "
"supported imports in `apps/frontend/src/site-ui/host.ts`."
msgstr ""
"宿主门面（host "
"facade）向模块提供公开的站点配置、解析后的品牌、会话状态（足以在登录链接和控制台链接之间选择），以及受支持的展示类型和辅助函数。它不提供登录、退出、令牌或其他任何认证操作。TypeScript"
" 接口在 `apps/frontend/src/site-ui/contract.ts` 中，受支持的导入在 `apps/frontend/src"
"/site-ui/host.ts` 中。"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:50
msgid "What a module may import"
msgstr "模块可以导入什么"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:52
msgid ""
"A module may import `@site-ui/host`, `react`, `react/*`, `react-dom`, "
"`next`, `next/*` and its own files. Anything else, `@/...` in particular,"
" fails the build. The build checks each request by the real path webpack "
"resolves it to, in every compilation, so these fail too:"
msgstr ""
"模块可以导入 `@site-ui/host`、`react`、`react/*`、`react-dom`、`next`、`next/*` "
"以及它自己的文件。其他任何导入（尤其是 `@/...`）都会使构建失败。构建在每次编译中都按 webpack "
"解析出的真实路径检查每个请求，因此以下情况同样会失败："

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:57
msgid "a relative path or a symlink that leads out of the module;"
msgstr "指向模块之外的相对路径或符号链接；"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:58
msgid ""
"a framework subpath that walks back out, such as `next/../../src/site-"
"ui/routes`;"
msgstr "借助上级目录跳出框架包的子路径，例如 `next/../../src/site-ui/routes`；"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:59
msgid "a stylesheet `@import` or `url()` that leaves the module;"
msgstr "指向模块之外的样式表 `@import` 或 `url()`；"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:60
msgid ""
"a computed import (`require.context`, `import.meta.webpackContext` or an "
"`import()` of a template literal) over a directory outside the module;"
msgstr ""
"对模块外目录的计算式导入（`require.context`、`import.meta.webpackContext`，或对模板字符串的 "
"`import()`）；"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:62
msgid "a `data:` or `file:` URI, or a Node.js built-in;"
msgstr "`data:` 或 `file:` URI，以及 Node.js 内置模块；"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:63
msgid ""
"an inline loader other than Next.js's own, such as `!!raw-"
"loader!./notes.txt`;"
msgstr "Next.js 自带 loader 以外的内联 loader，例如 `!!raw-loader!./notes.txt`；"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:64
msgid ""
"anything in a `node_modules` directory inside the module. Dependencies "
"come from the application's lockfile, and staging does not copy that "
"directory."
msgstr "模块内任何 `node_modules` 目录中的内容。依赖来自应用的 lockfile，暂存（staging）时也不会复制该目录。"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:67
msgid ""
"An earlier source check lists every problem it can see at once. It runs "
"when a module is staged and before every build, type check and test run. "
"Files under `test/`, `tests/`, `__tests__/` or `__mocks__/`, and "
"`vitest`, `jest` or `playwright` configuration, are exempt unless "
"production code imports them. Every symlink in the module must resolve "
"inside it."
msgstr ""
"一项更早的源码检查会一次性列出它能发现的所有问题。它在暂存模块时运行，也在每次构建、类型检查和测试之前运行。`test/`、`tests/`、`__tests__/`"
" 或 `__mocks__/` 下的文件，以及 `vitest`、`jest` 或 `playwright` "
"配置，除非被生产代码导入，否则不受检查。模块中的每个符号链接都必须解析到模块内部。"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:73
msgid "A module is a directory"
msgstr "模块是一个目录"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:85
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The root layout loads `styles.css` on every page, after the application's"
" own stylesheet, so a module rule wins over an application rule of the "
"same specificity. Do not import it yourself. `server.ts` must exist, but "
"may contain only `export {};`; its optional exports are described under "
"[Document language and page titles](#document-language-and-page-titles)."
msgstr ""
"根布局会在每个页面、在应用自己的样式表之后加载 "
"`styles.css`，因此特异性相同时，模块的规则优先于应用的规则。不要自己导入它。`server.ts` 必须存在，但可以只包含 "
"`export {};`；它的可选导出见[文档语言与页面标题](#document-language-and-page-titles)。"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:91
msgid "`client.tsx` exports:"
msgstr "`client.tsx` 的导出项："

