msgstr ""
"具名的对象字面量 `{ siteUiApi, id, locale }`；这三个值必须与 manifest 中的 "
"`site_ui_api`、`id` 和 `locale` 分别一致。"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md
msgid "`Landing`"
msgstr "`Landing`"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md
msgid "no"
msgstr "否"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md
msgid "Rendered at `/`. Supplying one replaces the console's home page."
msgstr "在 `/` 渲染。提供它会替换控制台首页。"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md
msgid "`AuthFrame`"
msgstr "`AuthFrame`"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md
msgid ""
"The frame around `/login`, `/signup`, `/forgot-password`, `/reset-"
"password`, `/verify-email`."
msgstr ""
"`/login`、`/signup`、`/forgot-password`、`/reset-password`、`/verify-email` "
"的外壳。"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md
msgid "`fieldLayout`"
msgstr "`fieldLayout`"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md
msgid "Where each account field's label, control, hint, error and action go."
msgstr "每个账号字段的标签、控件、提示、错误和操作放在哪里。"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md
msgid "`TermsFrame`"
msgstr "`TermsFrame`"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md
msgid "all three or none"
msgstr "三个要么都提供，要么都不提供"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md
msgid "The page around the module's legal text at `/terms`."
msgstr "`/terms` 上包裹模块法律文本的页面外壳。"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md
msgid "`TermsContent`"
msgstr "`TermsContent`"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md
msgid "The module's legal text, at `/terms` and in the sign-up consent step."
msgstr "模块的法律文本，用于 `/terms` 和注册同意步骤。"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md
msgid "`consentItems`"
msgstr "`consentItems`"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"What the sign-up consent step asks a visitor to confirm: a non-empty list"
" of `{ id, label, description? }`."
msgstr "注册同意步骤要求访客确认的内容：一个非空的 `{ id, label, description? }` 列表。"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md
msgid "`authAppearance`"
msgstr "`authAppearance`"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md
msgid ""
"Deprecated class-map compatibility for the shared forms, supported "
"throughout API v1."
msgstr "已弃用：为兼容而保留的共享表单类名映射，整个 API v1 期间都继续支持。"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md
msgid "`authMessages`"
msgstr "`authMessages`"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md
msgid "The deployment's wording for the account pages."
msgstr "部署自己为账号页面写的文案。"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:105
msgid ""
"The host reads named exports only. A default export from `client.tsx` "
"fails the build, and so does a second file for the same entry, such as "
"`client.js` next to `client.tsx`. `npm run type-check` and `next build` "
"check `client.tsx` against `SiteUiClientModule` and `server.ts` against "
"`SiteUiServerModule`, so a wrong export type, a partial legal set or an "
"empty `consentItems` fails with the export's name. As the module loads, "
"the host checks again for what a cast or `any` hides: a component export "
"that is not a component, a partial legal set, and `consentItems` that is "
"empty, repeats an id, or lacks an id or a label. Any of these stops the "
"module from loading."
msgstr ""
"宿主只读取具名导出。`client.tsx` 有默认导出会使构建失败；同一入口有第二个文件（例如 `client.tsx` 旁边还有 "
"`client.js`）也会失败。`npm run type-check` 和 `next build` 会用 "
"`SiteUiClientModule` 检查 `client.tsx`、用 `SiteUiServerModule` 检查 "
"`server.ts`，因此导出类型错误、法律文本组不完整或 `consentItems` "
"为空都会失败，并给出导出名。模块加载时，宿主还会再检查一遍类型转换或 `any` "
"掩盖的问题：不是组件的组件导出、不完整的法律文本组，以及为空、id 重复或缺少 id 或 label 的 "
"`consentItems`。其中任何一种都会阻止模块加载。"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:115
msgid ""
"**`next build` does not load the module.** Every page renders on demand, "
"so a mistake only the load-time check can see builds cleanly, then fails "
"the first request and answers HTTP 500 on every page from then on. Smoke-"
"test each image before releasing it: start it with its gateway and "
"request `/`, the five account pages and `/terms`."
msgstr ""
"**`next build` 不会加载模块。** "
"每个页面都按需渲染，所以只有加载时检查才能发现的错误能顺利通过构建，随后在第一个请求时失败，此后每个页面都返回 HTTP "
"500。发布每个镜像之前都要做冒烟测试：连同网关一起启动它，并请求 `/`、五个账号页面和 `/terms`。"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:121
msgid ""
"Optional exports can be left out. `Landing: null` keeps the console's "
"home page, and without `AuthFrame` the account pages sit in the console's"
" container."
msgstr "可选导出可以省略。`Landing: null` 保留控制台的首页；没有 `AuthFrame` 时，账号页面放在控制台的容器中。"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:124
msgid ""
"**A frame draws the whole page.** `AuthFrame` and `TermsFrame` render "
"their own header, `<main>` and footer; the host adds none around them. A "
"frame that draws only a card leaves the account pages without a header or"
" footer. `AuthFrame` must render the shared form it receives as "
"`children` and keep any `topbar` and `legal` nodes it is given; its "
"headings and page identifier let one frame serve all five account routes."
msgstr ""
"**外框要绘制整个页面。** `AuthFrame` 和 `TermsFrame` 自己渲染页头、`<main>` "
"和页脚；宿主不会在外面再加任何东西。只绘制一张卡片的外框会让账号页面既没有页头也没有页脚。`AuthFrame` 必须把收到的共享表单作为 "
"`children` 渲染出来，并保留传给它的 `topbar` 和 `legal` "
"节点；它的标题和页面标识让同一个外框可以服务全部五个账号路由。"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:131
msgid ""
"**Export the legal set together or not at all.** A module that publishes "
"its own terms exports `TermsFrame`, `TermsContent` and `consentItems`; "
"one that exports none of them keeps the console's terms and its four "
"confirmations. The host renders `TermsContent` wherever a visitor meets "
"the terms: at `/terms`, as the `children` of `TermsFrame` (`headingLevel`"
" 2, `compact` false), and in the sign-up consent step's scrolling box "
"(`headingLevel` 3, `compact` true), where the module's `consentItems` "
"replace the console's confirmations. The text a visitor accepts is the "
"text the site publishes."
msgstr ""
"**法律文本组要么一起导出，要么都不导出。** 发布自有条款的模块同时导出 `TermsFrame`、`TermsContent` 和 "
"`consentItems`；三者都不导出的模块沿用控制台的条款及其四项确认。访客在哪里看到条款，宿主就在哪里渲染 "
"`TermsContent`：在 `/terms` 作为 `TermsFrame` 的 `children`（`headingLevel` "
"2，`compact` false），以及在注册同意步骤的滚动框中（`headingLevel` 3，`compact` true），此时模块的 "
"`consentItems` 替换控制台的确认项。访客接受的文本就是站点发布的文本。"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:140
msgid ""
"`TermsContent` renders only the legal body: its sections and any "
"preamble, such as a date. The page heading belongs to the frame. At "
"`/terms`, give each section its `terms-s` anchor; the account pages link "
"privacy to `/terms#terms-s5`. Declare `consentItems` with the "
"`ConsentItems` type (a plain `ConsentItem[]` fails the type check, "
"because it does not promise one item) and give each item a unique `id`. "
"Every item unlocks once the visitor has read the terms to the end, and "
"Continue waits for all of them. Sign-up records a single `accepted_tos` "
"flag, sent only after every item is checked."
msgstr ""
"`TermsContent` 只渲染法律正文：各个章节以及日期之类的前言。页面标题属于外框。在 `/terms` 中，为每个章节加上 "
"`terms-s` 锚点；账号页面把隐私链接到 `/terms#terms-s5`。用 `ConsentItems` 类型声明 "
"`consentItems`（普通的 `ConsentItem[]` 无法通过类型检查，因为它不保证至少有一项），并为每一项设置唯一的 "
"`id`。访客把条款读到末尾后，每一项才会解锁，而“继续”要等所有项都勾选。注册只记录一个 `accepted_tos` "
"标志，并且只在每一项都勾选之后才发送。"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:149
msgid ""
"`authMessages` changes wording, not validation or the required fields. "
"The host keeps only the keys `AUTH_MESSAGE_KEYS` declares, with string "
"values, so wording for a console page (`auth.authorize.*`, `chat.*`) has "
"no effect. Missing keys keep the shared defaults; keep each message's "
"interpolation variables. The login method selector uses "
"`auth.login.method_label`, `auth.login.password_method` and "
"`auth.login.sms_method`; sign-up's email and phone choice uses "
"`auth.phone.method_label`, `auth.phone.email_method` and "
"`auth.phone.phone_method`."
msgstr ""
"`authMessages` 改变的是措辞，而不是校验或必填字段。宿主只保留 `AUTH_MESSAGE_KEYS` "
"声明的键且值为字符串的条目，因此为控制台页面写的措辞（`auth.authorize.*`、`chat.*`）不起作用。缺少的键沿用共享的默认值；请保留每条消息的插值变量。登录方式选择器使用"
" `auth.login.method_label`、`auth.login.password_method` 和 "
"`auth.login.sms_method`；注册时的邮箱或手机号选择使用 "
"`auth.phone.method_label`、`auth.phone.email_method` 和 "
"`auth.phone.phone_method`。"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:158
msgid ""
"A module's `authMessages` are written in the module's language (its "
"descriptor `locale`, or English when that is empty) and apply only to a "
"page in that language. A reader who chose another console language gets "
"the console's own translation of those pages; see [Translating the "
"console](translations.md#translating-the-console)."
msgstr ""
"模块的 `authMessages` 用模块的语言编写（它的 descriptor "
"`locale`，为空时为英文），只作用于该语言的页面。选择了其他控制台语言的读者，看到的是控制台自己对这些页面的翻译；见[翻译控制台](translations.md"
"#translating-the-console)。"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:164
msgid "Document language and page titles"
msgstr "文档语言与页面标题"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:166
msgid ""
"The server entry's optional `locale` sets `<html lang>` on the routes the"
" module renders: `/` when it exports `Landing`, the five account pages "
"when it exports `AuthFrame`, and `/terms` when it exports the legal set. "
"Every other route uses the reader's console language, English unless the "
"reader or their browser asks for another language the console ships. An "
"empty or omitted `locale` gives the module's routes the reader's language"
" too. The attribute follows client-side navigation."
msgstr ""
"服务端入口可选的 `locale` 会为模块渲染的路由设置 `<html lang>`：导出 `Landing` 时是 `/`，导出 "
"`AuthFrame` 时是五个账号页面，导出法律文本组时是 "
"`/terms`。其他所有路由都使用读者的控制台语言：默认英文，除非读者或其浏览器请求了控制台支持的其他语言。`locale` "
"为空或省略时，模块的路由也使用读者的语言。该属性会随客户端导航更新。"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:174
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The optional `metaMessages` words the titles and descriptions of the "
"seven public routes, with the keys `meta.<page>.title` and "
"`meta.<page>.description`, where `<page>` is `home`, `login`, `signup`, "
"`forgot`, `reset`, `verify` or `terms` (`META_MESSAGE_KEYS` in "
"`contract.ts`). It is filtered like `authMessages`. `meta.home.title` is "
"the whole document title; any other title is shown as `<title> | <site "
"name>`. Each value may use `{app_name}`. A page the module does not word "
"keeps its default, the site's title and description or \"Terms of "
"Service\" for `/terms`, whichever routes the module renders. Console "
"pages keep their English titles, and icons come from runtime branding."
msgstr ""
"可选的 `metaMessages` 为七个公开路由提供标题和描述，键为 `meta.<page>.title` 和 "
"`meta.<page>.description`，其中 `<page>` 是 "
"`home`、`login`、`signup`、`forgot`、`reset`、`verify` 或 `terms`（见 "
"`contract.ts` 中的 `META_MESSAGE_KEYS`）。它的过滤方式与 `authMessages` "
"相同。`meta.home.title` 是完整的文档标题；其他标题显示为 `<title> | <site name>`。每个值都可以使用 "
"`{app_name}`。模块没有提供措辞的页面沿用默认值，即站点的标题和描述，`/terms` 则为“Terms of "
"Service”，与模块渲染哪些路由无关。控制台页面保留英文标题，图标来自运行时品牌。"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:184
msgid "Building an image with a module"
msgstr "使用模块构建镜像"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:186
msgid ""
"The official frontend Dockerfile takes the module as a Buildx named "
"context:"
msgstr "官方前端 Dockerfile 通过 Buildx 命名上下文接收模块："

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md
msgid "Input"
msgstr "输入"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md
msgid "Default"
msgstr "默认值"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md
msgid "Meaning"
msgstr "含义"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md
msgid "`site-ui` context"
msgstr "`site-ui` 上下文"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md
msgid "the built-in marker"
msgstr "内置标记"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md
msgid "no external module; the neutral UI"
msgstr "没有外部模块，使用默认 UI"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md
msgid "`SITE_UI_SUBDIR`"
msgstr "`SITE_UI_SUBDIR`"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md
msgid "`.`"
msgstr "`.`"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md
msgid "the module's directory inside the context"
msgstr "上下文中的模块目录"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md
msgid "`SITE_UI_API`"
msgstr "`SITE_UI_API`"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md
msgid "unset"
msgstr "未设置"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md
msgid "required with an external module; must be `1`"
msgstr "使用外部模块时必填，必须为 `1`"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:212
msgid ""
"A distribution may pass its whole `frontend/` tree as the context and "
"select the module with `SITE_UI_SUBDIR=site-ui`, keeping the module and "
"its build inputs under one pinned tree. The build never falls back to the"
" neutral UI: an external context without a module fails, and so does "
"`SITE_UI_API`, or a `SITE_UI_SUBDIR` other than `.`, without `--build-"
"context site-ui=...`. The resolver also refuses a module that declares a "
"`SITE_UI_API` revision this checkout does not implement."
msgstr ""
"发行版可以把整个 `frontend/` 目录作为上下文传入，并用 `SITE_UI_SUBDIR=site-ui` "
"选择模块，这样模块及其构建输入都在同一棵钉住的目录树下。构建绝不会退回中性 UI：外部上下文中没有模块会失败；没有 `--build-"
"context site-ui=...` 却给出 `SITE_UI_API`，或给出 `.` 以外的 "
"`SITE_UI_SUBDIR`，同样会失败。解析器还会拒绝声明了本检出未实现的 `SITE_UI_API` 版本的模块。"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:220
msgid "Local development"
msgstr "本地开发"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:222
msgid ""
"The same staging step runs on a workstation, without Docker. Start a "
"gateway first, because every page reads its `/site-config`, and set "
"`BACKEND_INTERNAL_URL` to its address if it is not `http://backend:8080`:"
msgstr ""
"同样的暂存步骤也可以在工作站上运行，无需 Docker。先启动一个网关，因为每个页面都要读取它的 `/site-config`；如果它的地址不是 "
"`http://backend:8080`，请设置 `BACKEND_INTERNAL_URL`："

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:236
msgid ""
"Staging empties `--into` before copying, so `--into` must be a directory "
"of its own: it may not overlap `--context`, and may not be or contain "
"`--app`. Staging does not select the module for later commands; pass the "
"variables to each one. To skip staging, name the module directly:"
msgstr ""
"暂存会先清空 `--into` 再复制，因此 `--into` 必须是一个独立的目录：不能与 `--context` 重叠，也不能是或包含 "
"`--app`。暂存不会让后续命令自动选中该模块；每条命令都要传入这些变量。若不想暂存，可以直接指定模块："

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:246
msgid ""
"A relative `SITE_UI_DIR` resolves against `apps/frontend`. Tailwind scans"
" the selected module's directory as well as `src/`. In local development "
"`SITE_ASSETS_DIR` serves the module's assets; the image build packages "
"them. To return to the neutral UI, stop the server and run:"
msgstr ""
"相对的 `SITE_UI_DIR` 以 `apps/frontend` 为基准解析。Tailwind 除了 "
"`src/`，还会扫描所选模块的目录。本地开发时由 `SITE_ASSETS_DIR` 提供模块的静态资源；构建镜像时会把它们打包进去。要回到中性"
" UI，停止服务器并运行："

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:255
msgid ""
"The resolver writes `src/site-ui/active/` and `tsconfig.generated.json`, "
"so the bundler, the type checker and the test runner read the same "
"selection. Do not edit those generated files. Type checking reaches a "
"module's production code through its entries' imports, and the "
"application lints no module code, so a module's tests and tooling are for"
" the distribution's repository to check. A declaration file that nothing "
"imports, such as one holding an ambient `declare module`, is outside that"
" graph: reference it from an entry with `/// <reference "
"path=\"./types.d.ts\" />`."
msgstr ""
"解析器会写入 `src/site-ui/active/` 和 "
"`tsconfig.generated.json`，让打包器、类型检查器和测试运行器读取同一份选择。不要编辑这些生成的文件。类型检查通过入口的导入到达模块的生产代码，而应用不对模块代码做"
" lint，因此模块的测试和工具链应由发行版自己的仓库检查。没有被任何代码导入的声明文件（例如包含环境声明 `declare module` "
"的文件）不在这张依赖图中：请在某个入口中用 `/// <reference path=\"./types.d.ts\" />` 引用它。"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:264
msgid "Assets"
msgstr "资源"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:266
msgid ""
"A module's images live in `public/site-assets/<module-id>/`. The image "
"build packages them in `site-assets/<module-id>/` next to the standalone "
"server, not in `public/`, because Next.js serves `public/` before any "
"route and a file there would bypass the `/site-assets` route. The build "
"fails on an asset outside the module's own id, on an asset at a path the "
"application already ships, and on a bundle that still has files under "
"`public/site-assets/<module-id>/`."
msgstr ""
"模块的图片放在 `public/site-assets/<module-id>/`。构建镜像时，它们被打包到独立服务器旁边的 `site-"
"assets/<module-id>/`，而不是 `public/`，因为 Next.js 会在任何路由之前先提供 `public/` "
"中的文件，放在那里会绕过 `/site-assets` 路由。以下情况构建会失败：静态资源不在模块自己的 id "
"下；静态资源的路径与应用已有的文件相同；以及打包结果中 `public/site-assets/<module-id>/` 下仍有文件。"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:273
msgid ""
"`/site-assets/*` serves image files only (AVIF, GIF, ICO, JPEG, PNG, SVG "
"and WebP, up to 20 MB) with a five-minute revalidating cache policy and "
"`nosniff`, and sandboxes an SVG with a `Content-Security-Policy` header. "
"Test the URL, not the file. At runtime the route reads `SITE_ASSETS_DIR` "
"first and the image's own copy second, file by file, so a deployment that"
" mounts its branding directory overrides the module's files and one that "
"mounts nothing still serves a complete site."
msgstr ""
"`/site-assets/*` 只提供图片文件（AVIF、GIF、ICO、JPEG、PNG、SVG 和 WebP，最大 20 "
"MB），使用五分钟的重新验证缓存策略和 `nosniff`，并用 `Content-Security-Policy` 头把 SVG "
"放进沙箱。请测试 URL，而不是文件。运行时，该路由逐个文件先读取 "
"`SITE_ASSETS_DIR`，再读取镜像自带的副本，因此挂载了品牌目录的部署会覆盖模块的文件，什么都不挂载的部署也能提供完整的站点。"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:281
msgid ""
"`SITE_ASSETS_DIR` must be an absolute path. The console runs as uid 1000,"
" so the mounted directory and files must be readable by that user (`0755`"
" directories and `0644` files are enough); a file it cannot read is "
"answered as missing. The build copies a relative symlink as a link, so a "
"link that stays inside the module keeps working; the route does not serve"
" a link whose target is outside its directory."
msgstr ""
"`SITE_ASSETS_DIR` 必须是绝对路径。控制台以 uid 1000 运行，所以挂载的目录和文件必须对该用户可读（目录 "
"`0755`、文件 `0644` "
"即可）；它读不了的文件会被当作不存在。构建会把相对符号链接作为链接复制，因此指向模块内部的链接可以继续工作；该路由不会提供目标在其目录之外的链接。"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:288
msgid ""
"Every page is served with a `Content-Security-Policy` "
"(`apps/frontend/src/lib/security/contentSecurityPolicy.ts`). A module's "
"markup runs no inline `<script>` and no script from another host, its "
"stylesheets and fonts load from the console's origin, and its images load"
" from `/site-assets` or over HTTPS. Anything more needs a change to the "
"policy."
msgstr ""
"每个页面都带有 `Content-Security-"
"Policy`（`apps/frontend/src/lib/security/contentSecurityPolicy.ts`）。模块的页面不运行内联"
" `<script>`，也不运行来自其他主机的脚本；样式表和字体从控制台的源加载，图片从 `/site-assets` 或通过 HTTPS "
"加载。需要更多权限就得修改该策略。"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:294
msgid "Styling the shared forms"
msgstr "共享表单样式"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:296
msgid ""
"The shared account forms render their own markup and default styling. "
"Style them through `data-auth` attributes, and rearrange them with the "
"`fieldLayout` export."
msgstr "共享的账号表单自己渲染标记和默认样式。请通过 `data-auth` 属性为它们设置样式，并用 `fieldLayout` 导出调整排列。"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md
msgid "Attribute"
msgstr "属性"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md
msgid "On"
msgstr "所在元素"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md
msgid "`data-auth=\"form\"`"
msgstr "`data-auth=\"form\"`"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md
msgid ""
"the body of an account page: its `<form>`, or the box a result or the "
"sign-up consent step sits in"
msgstr "账号页面的主体：页面的 `<form>`，或者放结果、放注册同意步骤的那个容器"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md
msgid "`data-auth=\"field\"`"
msgstr "`data-auth=\"field\"`"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md
msgid "each field's wrapper"
msgstr "每个字段的外层元素"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md
msgid "`data-auth=\"label\"` / `\"control\"`"
msgstr "`data-auth=\"label\"` / `\"control\"`"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md
msgid "the label, and each input or textarea"
msgstr "标签，以及每个输入框或文本域"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md
msgid "`data-auth=\"hint\"` / `\"error\"`"
msgstr "`data-auth=\"hint\"` / `\"error\"`"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md
msgid "the hint and the error paragraph"
msgstr "提示与错误段落"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md
msgid "`data-auth=\"notice\"`"
msgstr "`data-auth=\"notice\"`"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md
msgid ""
"an info, error or success notice; a button inside one is `[data-"
"auth=\"notice\"] button`"
msgstr "信息、错误或成功提示；提示内的按钮可用 `[data-auth=\"notice\"] button` 选中"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md
msgid "`data-auth=\"submit\"`"
msgstr "`data-auth=\"submit\"`"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md
msgid "the page's primary button, or the link that stands in for it"
msgstr "页面的主按钮，或代替主按钮的链接"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md
msgid "`data-auth=\"field-action\"`"
msgstr "`data-auth=\"field-action\"`"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md
msgid "the wrapper around a field's own action, such as the forgot-password link"
msgstr "字段自身操作（如忘记密码链接）的外层元素"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md
msgid "`data-auth=\"secondary-actions\"`"
msgstr "`data-auth=\"secondary-actions\"`"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md
msgid ""
"alternative actions, including the method selector and links on `/verify-"
"email`"
msgstr "备选操作，包括方式选择器以及 `/verify-email` 上的链接"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md
msgid "`data-auth=\"consent\"`"
msgstr "`data-auth=\"consent\"`"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md
msgid "each sign-up confirmation: the label holding its checkbox and sentence"
msgstr "每个注册确认项：包含复选框及其说明文字的标签"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md
msgid "`data-auth=\"consent-section\"`"
msgstr "`data-auth=\"consent-section\"`"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md
msgid "each section of the sign-up consent step"
msgstr "注册同意步骤中的每个分区"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md
msgid "`data-auth=\"loading\"`"
msgstr "`data-auth=\"loading\"`"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md
msgid "the resolving-session region"
msgstr "正在解析会话时显示的区域"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:314
msgid ""
"State is in attributes the application already sets: `aria-invalid`, "
"`disabled`, `aria-busy`, `data-auth-error` and `data-auth-tone`. The "
"login and sign-up method group also carries `data-auth-method-selector`, "
"and its buttons use `aria-pressed` for the selected method. The attribute"
" set is part of the contract: attributes are added, never repurposed."
msgstr ""
"状态体现在应用已经设置的属性中：`aria-invalid`、`disabled`、`aria-busy`、`data-auth-error` 和"
" `data-auth-tone`。登录和注册的方式选择组还带有 `data-auth-method-selector`，其按钮用 `aria-"
"pressed` 表示选中的方式。这组属性是约定的一部分：只会新增，绝不挪作他用。"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:320
msgid ""
"`fieldLayout` receives the shared control, hint, error and action nodes, "
"and the label's text and `htmlFor` id. It must render every node, "
"associate the label with that id, and keep the `data-auth=\"field\"` and "
"`data-auth=\"label\"` hooks. The control arrives with `aria-describedby` "
"already naming the hint (`<id>-hint`) and error (`<id>-error`), and with "
"`aria-invalid=\"true\"` while the error shows, so any arrangement that "
"renders every node stays accessible. The neutral layout puts the field "
"action after the control; a module may put it beside the label."
msgstr ""
"`fieldLayout` 收到共享的控件、提示、错误和操作节点，以及标签文本和 `htmlFor` id。它必须渲染每个节点，把标签与该 id "
"关联，并保留 `data-auth=\"field\"` 和 `data-auth=\"label\"` "
"钩子。控件到达时已经带有指向提示（`<id>-hint`）和错误（`<id>-error`）的 `aria-"
"describedby`，错误显示时还带有 `aria-"
"invalid=\"true\"`，因此任何渲染了全部节点的排列都保持无障碍。中性布局把字段操作放在控件之后；模块可以把它放在标签旁边。"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:329
msgid ""
"The deprecated `authAppearance` class map holds class names only and "
"stays supported for as long as API v1 is. It will be removed only in a "
"later API revision, with a migration guide. Use `data-auth` and state "
"selectors for new styling."
msgstr ""
"已弃用的 `authAppearance` 类名映射只包含类名，在 API v1 存续期间一直受支持。它只会在以后的 API "
"版本中移除，届时会附迁移指南。新的样式请使用 `data-auth` 和状态选择器。"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:334
msgid ""
"**A module's CSS may affect only the pages it owns.** A rule that reaches"
" `body`, `:root` or a bare element selector restyles the console too, and"
" no check catches it. Scope every rule under a root class that the module"
" sets on its own shell."
msgstr ""
"**模块的 CSS 只能影响它拥有的页面。** 作用到 `body`、`:root` "
"或裸元素选择器的规则也会改变控制台的样式，而且没有任何检查能发现。请把每条规则都限定在模块在自己外壳上设置的根类名之下。"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:339
msgid "When a module component fails"
msgstr "模块组件出错时"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:341
msgid ""
"A module component that throws (`Landing`, `AuthFrame`, `fieldLayout`, "
"`TermsFrame` or `TermsContent`) takes down its own page and nothing else:"
" the route error page (`app/error.tsx`) replaces that page with a neutral"
" message and a **Try again** button, inside the console's header and "
"footer. It never falls back to the console's terms or confirmations."
msgstr ""
"抛出异常的模块组件（`Landing`、`AuthFrame`、`fieldLayout`、`TermsFrame` 或 "
"`TermsContent`）只会让它自己所在的页面出错：路由错误页（`app/error.tsx`）会用一条中性的消息和一个 **Try "
"again** 按钮替换该页面，并带上控制台的页头和页脚。它绝不会退回到控制台的条款或确认项。"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:347
msgid ""
"React renders no error boundary on the server, so the first response for "
"a failing page is still an error: HTTP 500, or HTTP 200 with a loading "
"state on `/login`, `/reset-password` and `/verify-email`. The browser "
"then shows the message. A status code alone does not show that a page "
"works. A module that fails its load-time check takes down every page, "
"because the root layout loads it."
msgstr ""
"React 不在服务端渲染错误边界，因此出错页面的第一个响应仍然是错误：HTTP 500，或者在 `/login`、`/reset-"
"password` 和 `/verify-email` 上是带加载状态的 HTTP "
"200。随后浏览器才显示错误消息。只看状态码无法说明页面正常。没有通过加载时检查的模块会让所有页面出错，因为根布局会加载它。"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:354
msgid "Compatibility"
msgstr "兼容性"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:356
msgid ""
"Adding a module does not change the console's pages, schemas or session "
"handling."
msgstr "添加模块不会改变控制台的页面、schema 或会话处理。"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:358
msgid ""
"Removing an optional export is safe: a module that stops exporting "
"`Landing` gets the console's home page back. The legal set is removed "
"whole; dropping only one of its exports fails the type check."
msgstr "移除可选导出是安全的：不再导出 `Landing` 的模块会重新用上控制台的首页。法律文本组要整体移除；只去掉其中一个导出会无法通过类型检查。"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:361
msgid ""
"Renaming or removing an export, changing a prop's meaning, repurposing a "
"`data-auth` value, or renaming a key in `authMessages` or `metaMessages` "
"(or changing its interpolation variables) is a breaking change and needs "
"a new API revision. Adding an optional key or attribute is compatible."
msgstr ""
"重命名或移除导出、改变某个 prop 的含义、把某个 `data-auth` 值挪作他用，或者重命名 `authMessages` 或 "
"`metaMessages` 中的键（或改变其插值变量），都属于破坏性变更，需要新的 API 版本。新增可选的键或属性则是兼容的。"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:366
msgid "Testing a module"
msgstr "测试模块"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:368
msgid ""
"These checks use the built-in neutral module and the public example; pass"
" the same module selection variables as for local development to check "
"your own:"
msgstr "这些检查使用内置的中性模块和公开示例；要检查你自己的模块，请传入与本地开发相同的模块选择变量："

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:378
msgid ""
"Exercise the normal, invalid, loading and keyboard states of the shared "
"forms, every public page your module supplies, and the console, to catch "
"style leakage. Then smoke-test the built image with a gateway behind it: "
"request `/`, the five account pages and `/terms`. This is the first point"
" at which the load-time check runs."
msgstr ""
"测试共享表单的正常、无效、加载和键盘操作状态，你的模块提供的每个公开页面，以及控制台，以发现样式泄漏。然后在后面接上网关，对构建好的镜像做冒烟测试：请求"
" `/`、五个账号页面和 `/terms`。加载时检查直到这一步才第一次运行。"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:384
msgid ""
"From the repository root, build the neutral image and the public example "
"with the same recipe (this needs Docker and network access):"
msgstr "在仓库根目录，用同样的方法构建中性镜像和公开示例（需要 Docker 和网络访问）："

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:397
msgid ""
"The first manifest must report `kind: \"neutral\"` and the second `id: "
"\"example\"`. This repository's CI runs both builds, and checks how the "
"example image serves its assets, on every change to the console or the "
"example module. Build and test your own image and assets as well."
msgstr ""
"第一个 manifest 必须报告 `kind: \"neutral\"`，第二个必须报告 `id: \"example\"`。本仓库的 CI "
"在控制台或示例模块每次变动时都会运行这两个构建，并检查示例镜像如何提供静态资源。也请构建并测试你自己的镜像和静态资源。"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:402
msgid "Maintaining the host"
msgstr "维护宿主"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:404
msgid ""
"This section is for contributors who change the Site UI support in the "
"shared application. Paths are under `apps/frontend/src/site-ui/` unless "
"noted."
msgstr "本节面向修改共享应用中 Site UI 支持的贡献者。除非另有说明，路径都在 `apps/frontend/src/site-ui/` 下。"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:407
msgid ""
"`resolve.js` selects the module and writes the generated files; "
"`prepare.js` runs it before the npm dev, build, type-check and test "
"scripts. Webpack, TypeScript, Vitest and Tailwind all read that one "
"selection, so tests cover the module the image compiles. A bare `tsc` "
"against the base project does not see the selected module; use `npm run "
"type-check`."
msgstr ""
"`resolve.js` 选择模块并写入生成的文件；`prepare.js` 在 npm 的 dev、build、type-check 和 "
"test 脚本之前运行它。Webpack、TypeScript、Vitest 和 Tailwind "
"都读取这同一份选择，因此测试覆盖的就是镜像编译的模块。直接对基础项目运行 `tsc` 看不到所选模块；请使用 `npm run type-"
"check`。"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:412
msgid ""
"`containment.js` enforces the import rule in every webpack compilation, "
"and `verify-imports.js` is the earlier source check. The source check may"
" miss what the webpack guard catches, but must never reject a module the "
"guard accepts."
msgstr ""
"`containment.js` 在每次 webpack 编译中强制执行导入规则，`verify-imports.js` "
"是更早的源码检查。源码检查可能漏掉 webpack 守卫能发现的问题，但绝不能拒绝守卫会接受的模块。"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:416
msgid ""
"`module.tsx` checks the client module as it loads, normalizes its "
"optional exports and filters `authMessages`; `meta.ts` filters "
"`metaMessages`."
msgstr ""
"`module.tsx` 在加载时检查客户端模块，规范化它的可选导出并过滤 `authMessages`；`meta.ts` 过滤 "
"`metaMessages`。"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:418
msgid ""
"`moduleRendersRoute()` in `SiteUiBoundary.tsx` decides which routes the "
"module renders, from its exports and never from a distribution id. The "
"page chrome (`PublicRouteBoundary.tsx`), the document language "
"(`SiteDocument.tsx`) and the error page all read it. `routes.ts` holds "
"the closed list of public routes."
msgstr ""
"`SiteUiBoundary.tsx` 中的 `moduleRendersRoute()` 根据模块的导出、而绝不根据发行版 "
"id，决定模块渲染哪些路由。页面外框（`PublicRouteBoundary.tsx`）、文档语言（`SiteDocument.tsx`）和错误页都读取它。`routes.ts`"
" 维护封闭的公开路由列表。"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:423
msgid ""
"`apps/frontend/scripts/site-ui/prepare-module.mjs` stages a module from a"
" build context and, after `next build`, assembles the standalone bundle "
"and its assets."
msgstr ""
"`apps/frontend/scripts/site-ui/prepare-module.mjs` 从构建上下文中暂存模块，并在 `next "
"build` 之后组装独立运行的包及其静态资源。"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:426
msgid ""
"`apps/frontend/tests/fixtures/site-ui-demo/` is a small independent "
"module that exercises the interface. Do not add a distribution-specific "
"branch to shared code to make it pass; the fixture is there to expose "
"such coupling."
msgstr ""
"`apps/frontend/tests/fixtures/site-ui-demo/` "
"是一个用来检验该接口的小型独立模块。不要为了让它通过而在共享代码中加入针对某个发行版的分支；这个测试夹具正是用来暴露这类耦合的。"

#: ../developer/site-ui-modules.md:430
msgid ""
"These checks hold a module to the interface; they are not a sandbox. A "
"module is compiled into the application and could reach around the host "
"facade, and the checks do not prove its runtime behavior, CSS scope or "
"accessibility. When you change the wiring, check rendered pages in a "
"browser: a test of the generated files does not show that the browser "
"received the styles."
msgstr ""
"这些检查让模块遵守接口约定，但它们不是沙箱。模块被编译进应用，有可能绕过宿主门面；这些检查也不能证明它的运行时行为、CSS "
"作用范围或无障碍性。修改接线时，请在浏览器中检查渲染出的页面：对生成文件的测试并不能说明浏览器收到了样式。"

